ation, language; by analogy, a margin (of a vessel, water, cloth, etc.)","k":"band, bank, binding, border, brim, brink, edge, language, lip, prating, (sea-)shore, side, speech, talk, (vain) words.","o":"or (in dual and plural) שֶׂפֶת; probably from H5595 (סָפָה) or H8192 (שָׁפָה) through the idea of termination (compare H5490 (סוֹף));","f":175,"es":[["labios",271],["orilla",22],["labio",13],["boca",13]]},"8194":{"l":"שָׁפָה","x":"shâphâh","p":"shaw-faw'","d":"a cheese (as strained from the whey)","k":"cheese.","o":"from H8192 (שָׁפָה) in the sense of clarifying;","f":1,"es":[["quesos",1]]},"8195":{"l":"שְׁפוֹ","x":"Shᵉphôw","p":"shef-o'","d":"Shepho or Shephi, an Idumaean","k":"Shephi, Shepho.","o":"or שְׁפִי; from H8192 (שָׁפָה); baldness (compare H8205 (שְׁפִי));","f":2,"es":[["sepho",1],["sephi",1]]},"8196":{"l":"שְׁפוֹט","x":"shᵉphôwṭ","p":"shef-ote'","d":"a judicial sentence, i.e. punishment","k":"judgment.","o":"or שְׁפוּט; from H8199 (שָׁפַט);","f":2,"es":[["juicios",2]]},"8197":{"l":"שְׁפוּפָם","x":"Shᵉphûwphâm","p":"shef-oo-fawm'","d":"Shephupham or Shephuphan, an Israelite","k":"Shephuphan, Shupham.","o":"or שְׁפוּפָן; from the same as H8207 (שְׁפִיפֹן); serpent-like;","f":2,"es":[["sephuphim",1]]},"8198":{"l":"שִׁפְחָה","x":"shiphchâh","p":"shif-khaw'","d":"a female slave (as a member of the household)","k":"(bond-, hand-) maid(-en, -servant), wench, bondwoman, womanservant.","o":"feminine from an unused root meaning to spread out (as a family; see H4940 (מִשְׁפָּחָה));","f":63,"es":[["sierva",73],["siervas",30],["criada",6],["criadas",3]]},"8199":{"l":"שָׁפַט","x":"shâphaṭ","p":"shaw-fat'","d":"to judge, i.e. pronounce sentence (for or against); by implication, to vindicate or punish; by extenssion, to govern; passively, to litigate (literally or figuratively)","k":"[phrase] avenge, [idiom] that condemn, contend, defend, execute (judgment), (be a) judge(-ment), [idiom] needs, plead, reason, rule.","o":"a primitive root;","f":203,"es":[["jueces",103],["juez",61],["juzgó",43],["juzgará",35]]}}